# Screen captures replayed through the wake guard. They must stay byte-exact:
# a real `wezterm cli get-text --escapes` capture carries CRLF line endings and
# the escape bytes the guard parses, and line 1 is the `# captured <ISO8601>
# pane=<id>` provenance line `capture.sh` writes. `-text` stops git from
# normalising them.
pkg/testdata/fleetpusher/*.txt -text
